<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`把 props 的展开结果打在屏幕上，这是最有说服力的一屏。

你写的是：@DataAssist[props]，一个类，里面两个私有字段，一个是 private var a 字符串，一个是 private let b 整数。

宏展开后，字段名后面加了下划线，同时多出两个属性：a 是 public mut prop，有 get 和 value 两个访问器；b 是 public prop，只有 get，因为它是 let。

注意这两点：第一，字段还是私有的，封装没有被破坏；第二，框架能通过生成的属性访问器读写它们。所以这不是「破坏封装的反射」，而是一种「不破坏封装的访问通道」，而且它靠的是宏生成的代码，不是反射。

还有一个顺序约束要记住：在 PO 上，@DataAssist 必须写在 @QueryMappersGenerator 之前，因为要先展开。这个坑在第十二章还会再提一次。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 8 章 · 数据 f_data · 8.2 续</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>props 展开：不破坏封装的「反射」</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>最有说服力的一屏</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 10 }}>你写的</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>@DataAssist[props]</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>public class A {"{"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    private var a: String = ''"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    private let b: Int64 = 0"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"}"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 'auto' }}>字段还是私有的，封装没有被破坏。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', marginBottom: 10 }}>宏展开后（等价）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>public class A {"{"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    private var a_: String = ''"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    private let b_: Int64 = 0"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    public mut prop a: String {"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        get() { a_ }"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        value(value) { a_ = value }"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    }"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    public prop b: Int64 { get() { b_ } }"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"}"}</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 132, background: 'rgba(245,158,11,0.07)', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #F59E0B', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F59E0B' }}>顺序约束</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 6 }}>在 PO 上，@DataAssist 必须写在 @QueryMappersGenerator 之前（先展开）。见第十二章。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 4 }}>只写 props 保护了封装（字段还是私有的），同时又能被框架读写 —— 靠的是宏生成的属性访问器，而不是反射。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #1E293B' }}>
